  As I've said here before, it's not having a full Ascension Kit 
that matters, it's having an Ascension state of mind.

  I suspect there are plenty of people who couldn't ascend with 
two pet Archons in black dragon scale mail with amulets of 
reflection and cloaks of magic resistance, and a magic whistle.
(I'm probably one of them.  I don't have the pacifist state of 
mind.)

  Other people have found things that make the game much easier 
to beat.  One person said that finding Magicbane and engraving
Elbereth in one turn with it seemed to make them unbeatable. (Not
me, btw.)  Someone else said the spell of charm monster made the
game almost too easy.

  Watching early wizards on nao is painful.  So many advantages
they pass up.  Knowing I was worse doesn't console me any, 
thanks.  I've had wizards who got silver dragon scale mail early
and still died quickly.

  No, as I think marvin shows, and your ascensions probably do 
too, is that it's not what you've got, it's what you do with it.


